      "q": "How much does Minburn Technology Group make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Minburn Technology Group has $767M in contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Minburn Technology Group won 453 awards this fiscal year and the average award size is $1.7M. Obligations are down 18.9% year over year and the current-year totals are partial."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which agencies buy from Minburn Technology Group?",
      "a": "General Services Administration is the largest buying agency at $261M. Department of Veterans Affairs follows at $143M, Department of State at $140M, Department of the Treasury at $78.1M, and Department of Energy at $55.6M. Other agencies with FY2026 to date obligations include NASA at $32.5M and Department of Defense at $15.1M."
